    "text": "Graph-Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks combine Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks and Dense Associative Memory on discrete spectral graphs.",
    "topic": "memory architecture"
  },
  {
    "text": "Computation in Graph-Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks is confined to a low-frequency subspace using a rigid spectral projector.",
    "topic": "memory architecture"
  },
  {
    "text": "The architecture replaces active gate-based error correction with passive, hardware-enforced mode suppression.",
    "topic": "memory architecture"
  },
  {
    "text": "A positive weighted-metric benchmark is proven for the Graph-Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks architecture.",
    "topic": "memory architecture"
  },
  {
    "text": "A corridor lower-bound mechanism is provided to show how denominator memory can hide large gradients in the architecture.",
    "topic": "memory architecture"
  }
